  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRevenueRecognitionFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(収益認識関係)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・収益を理解するための基礎となる情報&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:26.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;連結財務諸表「注記事項（収益認識関係）」に同一の内容を記載しているため、注記を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRevenueRecognitionFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
